            "scopeNote": {
                "default": "Zero matches means no matching records were found in the official datasets successfully checked. It does not establish that hazards or restrictions are absent. This is official-notice information, not navigational advice: consult official charts, current Local and Broadcast Notices to Mariners, VHF broadcasts and applicable Coast Guard instructions.",
